{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120571","id":3918067500,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7piPcs","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120571","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120571.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120571.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120571","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120571/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120571/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120571/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/7ab9974ce192e094393066e01e1c4848ef85a365","number":120571,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Implement script equivalents for locking and selection grouping nodes","user":{"login":"CD-DA","id":145823278,"node_id":"U_kgDOCLEWLg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145823278?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CD-DA","html_url":"https://github.com/CD-DA","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CD-DA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CD-DA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CD-DA/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CD-DA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CD-DA/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CD-DA/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CD-DA/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CD-DA/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CD-DA/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/3046\r\n\r\nThis provides a script equivalent for locking nodes which, as far as I'm aware, is only intuitively possible with the button on the viewport toolbar. This PR also adds a script equivalent for the other toolbar button, selection grouping, as they have related uses. \r\n\r\nI was inspired to make this PR after I kept trying to move collision objects around... only to realize a few minutes later that I accidentally moved the collision shape instead. The methods are usable for plugins and tool scripts, and they would find their use for something like loading and creating nodes with many accidentally selectable children.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nI opted to put the methods inside of `EditorInterface` instead of `Node` like in the proposal. I believe they are better suited there, as these methods are only relevant for `CanvasItem` and `Node3D` based nodes (and since it's related to editor buttons and functionality). \r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":307135532,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMDcxMzU1MzI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:plugin","name":"topic:plugin","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","d